      "id": "claim_6d9fe9684a084f56bca97e44e15da776",
      "statement": "The active Cloud/Fleet publication path is the scheduled or manually dispatched `changelog-weekly.yml` workflow, which invokes `scripts/changelog_pipeline.py weekly`; the workflow passes `--write` only outside dry runs and stages the Cloud and Fleet changelog outputs with encrypted held state in a review PR.",
